# The Flame of Uzel, the yeti cave, Hillsbrad Fields, Helcular's grave, Nethander Stead --------------

map Alterac Mountains
do 553.3
tip The Flame of Uzel burns in Growless Cave, in the middle of the Alterac Mountains due north of the Foothill Caverns. Ogres and yetis of level 34-35 stand on the way, and two yetis wait by the flame: clear them together before you use it.
map Hillsbrad Foothills
do 553.1
tip Back in the Foothill Caverns: the Flame of Azel is on the top floor, up to the right from the entrance, at the far end.
do 553.2
tip The Flame of Veraz is on the bottom floor: take the curving ramp down to the left and follow the tunnel.
do 532
tip The town hall is the big house in the west of Hillsbrad Fields. Magistrate Burnside stands in its large room with the Proclamation in front of him and the Registry (a book) in the corner; the Councilmen are in and around the house. The rooms are packed, with casters that shoot through doorways: pull carefully and expect two or three at once. The Registry respawns within a minute, so both of you get one.
turnin 553
tip Helcular's grave is the easternmost one of the Southshore graveyard, next to the river. The elite Southshore guards see through stealth and daze you. Stay away from the town: come up from the river on the east side and slip between the two trees just before the graveyard, click the grave and leave the same way. A Lesser Invisibility Potion helps; if a guard catches you, die near the grave, run back as a ghost, resurrect beside it and click it at once.
do 509
tip The Mudsnout Blossoms grow thickly in the field of Nethander Stead, east of the river from Southshore, and respawn fast. Gnolls (shamans among them) guard it and respawn quickly in random spots: expect two or three at once.

# Tarren Mill -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

