# Dun Garok -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 547 bg
tip Any dwarf of Dun Garok can drop Humbert's Sword, but players find it rare in this game. When it drops, both of you can loot it. Not dropped by the time the keep is cleared for the Battle of Hillsbrad and the keg? Right-click to skip Humbert's Sword.
do 541
tip Dun Garok is the dwarven keep in the far south-east. Its Mountaineers, Riflemen and Priests are elites of level 28-30 that stand close together and respawn fast: pull into the doorways, kill the Priests first, and stop runners before they bring friends. Captain Ironhill (elite, 32) is either downstairs in the dining hall or upstairs in a barracks room: clear the room beside his first. If his guards come with him, drag them all outside and keep hitting the Captain until the others give up and go back.
do 517
tip One keg of Shindigger Stout sits inside the keep, at one of several spots that change: the two mess halls on either side at the top of the stairs (one hides behind a pile of boxes), the foot of either staircase, or the hall at the bottom of the main stairs by the fireplace. Check them all, and pull the elites one at a time on the way.

